

# Playwright's saved staff session.
#
# It holds a live admin bearer token. It was tracked, so every commit wrote a fresh
# working credential for the admin panel into the repository — a panel that is on the
# public internet and holds every customer's name and phone number. The file is
# regenerated by `auth.setup.ts` on each run and belongs to nobody but the machine
# that made it.
e2e/.auth/
